Blocks & Ledgers — a whiteboard film of "Basics with Block: Blocks and Distributed Ledgers"
Article and character "Block": blackboardblock (https://blackboardblock.medium.com/basics-with-block-blocks-and-distributed-ledgers-ef7ec49010fb).
Names in the ledger example (Ana, Ben, Cem) are invented.

Picture
  Drawn entirely by code (film.js, engine/wb.js). No generated images, no stock footage, no third-party artwork.
  engine/wb.js is adapted from the whiteboard engine of the Lemo-Opuscar style library
  (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, MIT; notice in engine/LICENSE), made size-aware for 1080×1920.

Lettering (on the board)
  EMS Tech — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt). Single-line font by Sheldon B. Michaels,
  a derivative of "Architects Daughter" by Kimberly Geswein; SVG conversion by Windell H. Oskay (Evil Mad Scientist).

Voice
  None. The film has no narration and no subtitles: every word is handwritten on the board.

Music
  Original score, synthesized in music.py: kalimba, music box and upright bass pizzicato by physical/modal
  modelling (Lemo-Opuscar core/audio/pluck.py), shaker synthesized from filtered noise. No samples.

Foley and sound design
  Original, synthesized in mix.py (marker on gloss, squeaks, magnets, eraser, oven ding, cap, whooshes, room tone).
